Who knows?

107
00:04:10.501 --> 00:04:13.170
{\an8}And. I mean.
the strippers. obviously.

108
00:04:13.253 --> 00:04:15.214
{\an8}And for the record.
a crying clown is.

109
00:04:15.297 --> 00:04:16.591
{\an8}in fact. the creepiest clown.

110
00:04:16.674 --> 00:04:18.259
