{\an8}God forbid.

138
00:05:09.518 --> 00:05:11.187
{\an8}Do not knock that girl.

139
00:05:11.270 --> 00:05:12.355
{\an8}She's in touch with her feelings

140
00:05:12.438 --> 00:05:15.149
{\an8}and a great communicator.
