141
00:05:15.232 --> 00:05:16.484
{\an8}You said that already.

142
00:05:16.567 --> 00:05:18.152
{\an8}Listen to me.

143
00:05:18.235 --> 00:05:20.154
{\an8}Nature abhors a vacuum.

144
00:05:20.237 --> 00:05:24.116
