204
00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:22.318
That's what...
how much is this fee?

205
00:07:22.401 --> 00:07:23.277
900 a month.

206
00:07:23.360 --> 00:07:24.361
900?

207
00:07:24.444 --> 00:07:25.654
Now. I know
that seems like a lot.

208
00:07:25.737 --> 00:07:27.281
